/**************************/
/* START OF PRE-NARRATIVE */
/**************************/


:: name_set1
<<cacheaudio title src/assets/music/Title.mp3>>
<<masteraudio volume 0.25>>
<<audio "title" loop play>>
/* Gradient from black to white after some scrolling, then the below.*/

<<type 30ms>>
\> You're finally here.

\> This story is about you. What should we call you?


\>> I think... I think you can call me <<textbox "$name" "???" "name_confirm">>

<</type>>

:: name_confirm

/* Variable below to smooth the first sentence from second question? */
<<set $name_resel to false>>

<<type 30ms>>
\> $name. A lot is going to happen, $name.

\> If it's any consolation, it's all in your hands.


\>> [[[Wait. I think I might be someone else?|name_reselect]]]

\>> [[[.. What do you mean? What is this?|question2]]]

<</type>>

:: name_reselect

<<type 30ms>>

\> It's so easy to forget, isn't it? Who are you, then?

\>> <<textbox "$name" "???" "name_reconfirm">> That's it.


<</type>>

:: name_reconfirm

/* Variable below to smooth the first sentence from second question? */
<<set $name_resel to true>>

<<type 30ms>>
\> You know this for sure, $name?

\> After all, you should be certain.


\>> [[[.. One more time.|name_reselect]]]

\>> [[[Yes. I do.|question2]]]

<</type>>

:: question2

<<type 30ms>>  /* REQUIRES VARIABLES TO CONTROL THE BOTTOM TWO OPTIONS */

<<if $name_resel is true and not $customEnrapture>>

\> Wonderful. We need to know - what enraptures you?

<<elseif $customEnrapture and not $scarePrompt is true>>

\> Oh, I don't doubt it. Try again though.

<<elseif $scarePrompt is true>>

\> We must be, yes. We're sorry, but this is the way forward. For you.

<<elseif $name_resel is false>>

\> You'll see in due time. For now, we must know - what enraptures you?
<<else>>

<</if>>
/* Need to turn these into buttons then set a variable based on the answer IF it ends up doing anything */
\>> [[Pure darkness as far as I can see.|pre-wakeup]]

\>> [[A grating, droning noise - somehow from everywhere and nowhere.|pre-wakeup]]

\>> [[A cold so intense, I can't even feel it.|pre-wakeup]]

\>> [[Losing myself in a tangle of endless corridors.|pre-wakeup]]

<<if not $customEnrapture>>
\>> No.. It must be <<textbox "$customEnrapture" "" "question2">>
<</if>>
<<if not $scarePrompt is true>>
\>> [[You're starting to scare me??|question2][$scarePrompt to true]]
<</if>>


<</type>>

:: pre-wakeup

<<type 30ms>>
\> Wonderful. You're doing so well. Are you ready?

\> After all, you should be certain.


\>> [[[Yes.|wakeup]]]

\>> [[[No! What is this? What's happening??|pre-wakeup]]]

<</type>>

/*******************/
/* AFTER WAKING UP */
/*******************/

:: wakeup

